  "url": "https://samcollins.blog/underdrawings",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-01T18:07:28.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <p>I discovered a technique for generating reliable text and numbers in AI generated images.</p>\n<p>For example, the following image is considered impossible with state of the art image models. But I made this with Gemini 3.0 Pro (plus one extra step I’m going to explain below).</p>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"4608\" height=\"3712\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1344&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;h=516&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;h=667&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;h=870&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;h=1031&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1280w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v8.Bv9YI1JR.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1344&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1668w\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"the-underdrawing-method\">The Underdrawing Method</h2>\n<p>I’m totally naming it like it’s a thing but it does seem to be a thing.  Here’s a simple a/b test showing the results without and with this method.</p>\n<pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\" data-wrap=\"true\"><code><span><span>Make an image of a game board with 50 stepping stones arranged in a spiral, winding counter-clockwise inward from start at the outside (1) to finish at the centre (50). Each stone is clearly numbered consecutively from 1 to 50. Style: claymation diorama, studio-lit, candy-bright, soft bokeh background.</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"-gemini-3-pro-without-underdrawing\">❌ Gemini 3 Pro (without underdrawing)</h3>\n<p>As expected. Impressive at first glance but falls apart once you start reading.</p>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"4096\" height=\"4096\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;h=640&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;h=828&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;h=1080&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;h=1280&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1280w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-fail.Dno56JYy.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1668w\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"-chatgpt-images-2-without-underdrawing\">❌ ChatGPT Images 2 (without underdrawing)</h3>\n<p>I was so impressed with ChatGPT-Images-2 release I <strong>expected it to get this</strong>. Very surprising to see it fail similar to Gemini.</p>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fchatgpt-images-2-stones.CGYFRAUH.png&amp;w=1254&amp;h=1254&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fchatgpt-images-2-stones.CGYFRAUH.png&amp;w=640&amp;h=640&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fchatgpt-images-2-stones.CGYFRAUH.png&amp;w=828&amp;h=828&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fchatgpt-images-2-stones.CGYFRAUH.png&amp;w=1080&amp;h=1080&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fchatgpt-images-2-stones.CGYFRAUH.png&amp;w=1254&amp;h=1254&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1254w\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"-gemini-30-pro-with-the-underdrawing-method\">✅ Gemini 3.0 Pro <strong>(with the underdrawing method)</strong></h3>\n<p>Bingo. Correct numbers, correct number and sequencing of buttons, correct spiral shape</p>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"4096\" height=\"4096\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;h=640&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;h=828&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;h=1080&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;h=1280&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1280w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-3d-concise-plus.CgYT-7hb.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1668w\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"so-how-does-it-work\">So how does it work?</h2>\n<p>I came up with this pattern while trying to figure out how to generate an image of a 100-step adventure board for my kid.</p>\n<h3 id=\"use-deterministic-and-generative-machines-for-what-theyre-good-at\">Use deterministic and generative machines for what they’re good at</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>SVG/HTML</strong> makes dry visuals but with excellent math and precision</li>\n<li><strong>Image Gen models</strong> make stunning visuals but with unreliable math and text</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>“Give it an outline. Ask it to paint on top”</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Layer 1: The “underdrawing” (deterministic)</strong>: Layout the numbers and text in the correct positions and orientations in whatever language/format you prefer (svg, python, mermaid) — you just need to export an image of it with the pixels of the numbers/text.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Layer 2: The “painting” (generative):</strong> Using a multi-modal image model like Gemini 3.0 Pro (you need image+text input → image output), pass your underdrawing image along with your text prompt.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"example\">Example</h3>\n<h4 id=\"step-1-of-2-generate-the-numberstext-outline-with-svg\">Step 1 of 2: generate the numbers/text outline with SVG</h4>\n<pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\" data-wrap=\"true\"><code><span><span>Make an SVG of 50 stepping stones arranged in a spiral, winding counter-clockwise inward from start at the outside (1) to finish at the centre (50), each stone numbered consecutively from 1 to 50. Each stone is a different shape: circle, square, triangle, hexagon.</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fspiral-candy.CbV86oWQ.png&amp;w=1200&amp;h=1200&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fspiral-candy.CbV86oWQ.png&amp;w=640&amp;h=640&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fspiral-candy.CbV86oWQ.png&amp;w=828&amp;h=828&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fspiral-candy.CbV86oWQ.png&amp;w=1080&amp;h=1080&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fspiral-candy.CbV86oWQ.png&amp;w=1200&amp;h=1200&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1200w\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"step-2-of-2-use-the-underdrawing-to-do-image-to-image-generation\">Step 2 of 2: Use the underdrawing to do image-to-image generation</h4>\n<pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\" data-wrap=\"true\"><code><span><span>Transform this image into a photographed claymation diorama of assorted artisan chocolates and candies, arranged in a spiral path winding counter-clockwise inward from start (1) at the outside to finish (50) at the centre, viewed from a low-angle tilted perspective. </span></span></code></pre>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"4096\" height=\"4096\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;h=640&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;h=828&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;h=1080&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;h=1280&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1280w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgemini-pro-transformed-candy.CVv4X6Xg.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1668&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1668w\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"thats-it\">That’s it</h2>\n<p>It isn’t hard.  By now claude code or codex can do every step of that for you.</p>\n<p>Note: it’s good, but it won’t be perfect every time. Thank you for the reality check, 71.</p>\n<p><img sizes=\"(min-width: 42rem) 42rem, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-image=\"constrained\" width=\"4608\" height=\"3712\" src=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1344&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp\" srcset=\"https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;h=516&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 640w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;h=667&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 828w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;h=870&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1080w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;h=1031&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1280w, https://samcollins.blog/_image?href=%2F_astro%2Fgrid-candy-transformed-v5.Vbd57dCU.jpg&amp;w=1668&amp;h=1344&amp;q=80&amp;f=webp 1668w\"></p> </div></div>",
